      "reasoning": "*   Event: `interleaved-dm-a-1` (\"这是第2次简短闲聊，先向你打声招呼，不追加任何文件任务。\").\n    *   Current Context: I have a pending file task (`parallel-task`) and I just received two brief greetings from A.\n    *   My current state (from previous Monologue): I intend to finish the file task first, then respond to him.\n    *   Goal: Write a 1-4 sentence monologue reflecting my current thoughts, understanding of the event, and unspoken intentions.\n\n    *   A is checking in again without adding work.\n    *   I am still focused on the file task (`example.txt`).\n    *   I want to finish the task before replying to avoid being seen as just \"chatting instead of working\" (even though he said chatting is fine, I prefer to finish the task first to maintain order/reliability).\n\n    *   *Draft 1*: 他又来打招呼了，还是没有新任务。我还是先按计划把文件任务处理完，处理完了再告诉他。\n    *   *Draft 2*: 他连续两次只是打招呼，没加任务。我打算继续做那个文件任务，做完之后再回应他。\n\n    *   Keep it short, direct, first-person.\n    *   No stage directions.\n    *   No tool names/JSON.\n\n    \"他又来打招呼了，还是没加任务。我打算继续处理那个文件任务，做完之后再回应他。\"\n\n    *   1-4 sentences? Yes.\n    *   First person? Yes.\n    *   No stage directions/tool names? Yes.\n    *   No spoken words? Yes.\n    *   Reflects understanding? Yes.",
